      "id": 51023,
      "name": "Season 2",
      "overview": "It was announced that Hubert Urbański and Magdalena Mielcarz will not be back to present the series. Tomasz Kammel and Marika, polish reggae singer, will present the show instead. Maciej Musiał will replace Mateusz Szymkowiak as a V Reporter. The new season will feature a new judging panel. The new judges are Justyna Steczkowska, Patrycja Markowska, Marek Piekarczyk and Tomson & Baron from Afromental. For this season, during the battle round, opposing coaches have the ability to steal the singer that was sent home by the original coach. If more than one coach hits their buzzer to recruit the singer in question, it's up to the contestant to decide which coach he or she wants to work with. On April 6, 2013 it was reported, that Iga Krefft will join Musiał as a V Reporter.",
